    {
      "id": "notes",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 994,
      "height": 205.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1701940701,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1783171804,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The reminders epic: a patient is reminded before appointments (US-16), before events\n(US-31) and at medication times (US-32), and chooses which in the notification\npreferences (US-37). A caregiver can be reminded of the patient's (US-21, US-33, US-34).\nSaving an appointment, an event or a prescription reschedules its reminders;\na notification opens the appointment, event or prescription it is about.\nAt sign-in and after a phone restart, the reminders are scheduled again; SignOut cancels\nthe account's pending ones (#454). An appointment reminder has an \"Open symptoms\nsummary\" action that opens the summary directly, after sign-in if needed (US-48, see Appointments).\nAppointment reconciliation is built but not collected: activation and tap navigation follow.",
      "originalText": "The reminders epic: a patient is reminded before appointments (US-16), before events\n(US-31) and at medication times (US-32), and chooses which in the notification\npreferences (US-37). A caregiver can be reminded of the patient's (US-21, US-33, US-34).\nSaving an appointment, an event or a prescription reschedules its reminders;\na notification opens the appointment, event or prescription it is about.\nAt sign-in and after a phone restart, the reminders are scheduled again; SignOut cancels\nthe account's pending ones (#454). An appointment reminder has an \"Open symptoms\nsummary\" action that opens the summary directly, after sign-in if needed (US-48, see Appointments).\nAppointment reconciliation is built but not collected: activation and tap navigation follow.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
